om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JEjrHoDb3qgQ7kNvwFi21z9&_nc_oc=AdlkWeBGTtPl-iRN9y1SmMW3A0w41etD7vPiys_QhZmRKHMBK1zUWFC9mflFY3yDm8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuCXG_VNh_36aG-1_RZTg5iueLZM6fVuNcV4OdZmz_XHQ&oe=699867ED"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eE5faMzue7gQ7kNvwHjcJpQ&_nc_oc=AdmyWQsOsjNmPxF6a7oGloLTHzhhjX03TKjybaL3RN_VL7y9nCkN0cmPFWaso6EAWgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_9N0GtvQ-TcFd5UBbv2z2ydWSUGgvNFDsBAChGWob5Q&oe=69986837"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sOusEbkUXWIQ7kNvwE1Kro-&_nc_oc=AdnYssWqf6_GP1P1Qj3FUzdQH_xATJCSIDoIcXNhTLrJ4IjbyNo_RyGdVVfpw8vmRZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv9K8D8qObBDUWbQW6jKS0rk7Iqytz6b7g2oc6qkWjV-Q&oe=6998402C"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth